! mcp_bootstrap_p279.strap -- MCP printed page 279: the loader's
! INITIALIZATION ROUTINE (L INIT .. B,LFWA) and the opening of the IOD
! CARD ROUTINE (L IODRN .. L IOFUL), lines 1-56.
!
! 2026-11-06: "$OP" IS NOW WRITTEN AS PRINTED.  C28-6129 printed p.10 (PDF
! p.14): a $ prefixed to an operation code "directs the compiler to
! suppress any error indications" for that statement; the binary is
! the plain operation's, and strap_asm accepts the prefix.  Notes below
! that describe writing the card WITHOUT the "$" predate this.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.30, read at 400 dpi, doubtful glyphs
! at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP  CARD
! ID QD000152  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 279" (round glyphs in
! numeric fields read 0).  The heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK
! (line 1 is a remark card).
!
! THE PAGE.  56 lines; every line number prints a "*" after it.  Lines
! 1-4 are remark cards (banner "INITIALIZATION ROUTINE"), lines 43-47
! remark cards (banner "IOD CARD ROUTINE").  Located rows run
! contiguous from 231715.40 (line 5) to 231750.00 (line 42, a half
! word) and from 231750.40 (line 48) to 231757.40 (line 56, a half
! word; next location 231760.00), then blank paper.  "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 5, 22 and 38.  This routine is the body-assembly
! twin of the IPL assembly's printed pp.52-53 (decks/mcp_bootstrap_
! p52/p53.strap), whose statements match these card for card except
! line 17 (here "L,TJBPRO(LWORKX)", there "L(BU,1),TJBPRO(LXPP)") and
! line 19 (here "L,TCRREF(LWORKX)") and the new lines 6-16.
!
! JOIN.  p.278 is not landed and no neighbour deck exists in scratch,
! so contiguity with it is NOT established here; the body volume OCR
! (finding aid) shows "LFWA BB,1.1(LIODX),LIOORN" printing 231750.74,
! i.e. LIODRN at 231750.40, which this page's line 48 defines there.
! p.280 should open at 231760.00 with serial QD000208 (the volume OCR
! puts "B,LERR4" at QD000208, as p.53's LIOFUL is followed by B,LERR4).
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 48 label prints "L ICDRN": an open O and a D with worn stem.
!     Written LIODRN: p.53 "LIODRN M+1,TIODCT(LXPP)" is this card, p.146
!     notes the spelling IODRN, the comment is "-STEP IOD COUNTER"; the
!     volume OCR reads the reference "LIOORN".
!   * line 17 ",TJBPRC" = TJBPRO (open O): landed p.53/p.62 "TJBPRO
!     SYN(BU,1),0.36"; the row prints 000000.44 (bit 36) length 1.
!   * line 25 prints "$TI,1,-1.0(LIODX),1.0(LXPP)" (a "$" before the
!     operation, as printed p.53 line 14 does on the same card).  Written
!     "TI" as p.53 does; the row 777777.00 83 000001.02 A4 is a plain TI.
!     strap_asm refuses "$TI" (unknown mnemonic); the body OCR also
!     carries this card as the label of LFINAL on a later page.
!   * "LIOCX" (lines 5, 27) = LIODX, worn D; "LXIC"/"LXIO" = LXIO;
!     "LIOC1"/"LIOD1" = LIOD1; "CMOCOO" = CM0000 (open 0s) -- all names
!     that the landed IPL decks spell and the binaries agree with.
!   * line 41 last byte prints "FC" = F0 (as lines 9-11, 39 print F0).
!   * lines 13 and 14 end in a COMMENT MARK ("Z,0.0(LWORKX)-",
!     "CBR+,LWORKX,$-.32-", remark following); written without it.
!   * line 38's label prints "LINITC" with no blank after the L (every
!     other label on the page prints "L xxxx"); the same symbol.
!
! EXTERNALS.  Values come from THIS page's binary (the body assembly;
! the IPL decks pp.48-58 carry other addresses for the same names).
! Data descriptions follow the landed IPL decks and the body volume OCR
! (L SAVEY/L SAVEZ/L CLEAR are XW cards, L INFAD DD(BU,1), L COUNT
! DRZ(BU,7)).  Index registers as the IPL decks write them.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  QD000152 .. QD000207, one per line, none skipped.

LIODX   SYN, $3                      ! landed p.53; line 5 1.0(LIODX) 83
LXPP    SYN, $4                      ! landed p.53; line 15 000024.24, line 24 04
LXIO    SYN, $5                      ! landed p.53; line 37 05
LXFR    SYN, $6                      ! landed p.52; line 7 SX .15
LWORKX  SYN, $10                     ! landed p.53; line 13 0A
LSAVEY  SYN(BU), (8)231547.0         ! not landed in the body (XW per OCR); SX line 6 231547.13, half word only
LSAVEZ  SYN(BU), (8)231550.0         ! not landed in the body (XW per OCR); SX line 7 231550.15, half word only
LCLEAR  SYN(BU), (8)231552.0         ! not landed in the body (XW per OCR); LX line 12 231552.24, half word only
LFINB   SYN(BU,1), (8)231545.51      ! not landed in the body; CM0000 line 9 231545.51, BIT-EXACT
LINFAD  SYN(BU,1), (8)231545.73      ! not landed in the body (DD(BU,1) per OCR); line 10 231545.73, BIT-EXACT
LCOUNT  SYN(BU,7), (8)231545.53      ! not landed in the body (DRZ(BU,7) per OCR); line 11 231545.53 007000, BIT-EXACT
LOVBIT  SYN(BU,1), (8)231545.62      ! not landed in the body; BB line 33 231545.62, BIT-EXACT
LIOSCR  SYN(BU,9), (8)231545.40      ! not landed in the body; line 39 231545.40 011000, BIT-EXACT
LTAPEC  SYN(BU,7), (8)231545.31      ! not landed in the body; line 41 231545.31 007000, BIT-EXACT
LIOD    SYN, (8)231700.0             ! not landed in the body; K line 29 231700.00 (explicit dds), half word only
LFWA    SYN(BU,64,8), (8)231714.0    ! not landed in the body (BB card per OCR); B line 42 231714.10, half word only
LFINAL  SYN(BU,64,8), (8)232126.0    ! not landed in the body (TI card per OCR); BRZ line 28 232126.34, half word only
LERROR  SYN(BU,64,8), (8)232200.0    ! not landed in the body (CM1111 card per OCR); B line 32 232200.10, half word only
LERR4   SYN(BU,64,8), (8)232222.40   ! not landed in the body (SWAPI card per OCR); B line 23 232222.50, half word only
LIOD1   SYN(BU,64,8), (8)231761.0    ! not landed (L(BU,48) card, p.53); BRZZ line 55 231761.34, half word only
TJBPRO  SYN(BU,1), 0.36              ! landed p.53/p.62; L line 17 000000.44 (printed "TJBPRC")
TCRREF  SYN(BU,18), 0.0              ! landed p.53/p.62; L line 19 022000
TLPPEN  SYN(BU,1), 0.39              ! landed p.53/p.62; CM1111 line 26 000000.47
TIODCT  SYN(BU,12), 0.52             ! landed p.53/p.62; M+1 line 48 000000.64 014000
LIREF   SYN(BU,12), 0.52             ! landed p.48/p.53; L line 49 000000.64 014000
TLREFN  SYN(BU,12), 0.40             ! landed p.53/p.62; K line 50 000000.50 014000

        SLC, (8)231715.40
! line  1  - -----------------------------------------------------------
! line  2  -          INITIALIZATION ROUTINE
! line  3  - -----------------------------------------------------------
! line  4  -
LINIT   L(BU,24),1.0(LIODX)                                  ! line  5  ("LIOCX")
        SX,LXIO,LSAVEY                                       ! line  6  -SAVE THE IOREQ INDEX
        SX,LXFR,LSAVEZ                                       ! line  7  -SAVE THE FREEL TABLE INDEX
        BRZ,LINITA+1.                                        ! line  8  -IF REJ END COMBO
LINITA  CM0000(BU,1),LFINB,0.0                               ! line  9  -FINAL BIT TO 0.
        CM0000,LINFAD                                        ! line 10  -ZERO THE INF DISK
        CM0000,LCOUNT                                        ! line 11  -ZERO RLSYM NO. COUNT.
        LX,LWORKX,LCLEAR                                     ! line 12  -CLEAR RLSYM COUNT TABLE
        Z,0.0(LWORKX)                                        ! line 13  comment mark; SYMBOLIC CHANNEL AND UNIT TABLES
        CBR+,LWORKX,$-.32                                    ! line 14  comment mark; AND THE NON TAPE TABLES
        LX,LWORKX,LXPP                                       ! line 15  -LOOK AT THE NEXT PP REF SLOT WITHOUT
        V+ICR,LWORKX,2.0                                     ! line 16  -DESTROYING THE LXPP INDEX.
        L,TJBPRO(LWORKX)                                     ! line 17  -IS THE NEXT PP REF TBL SLOT AVAILABLE ("TJBPRC")
        BZRZZ,LINITB                                         ! line 18  -   YES----STEP DOWN.
        L,TCRREF(LWORKX)                                     ! line 19  -IS THE NEXT PP REF TBL SLOT AVAILABLE
        BRZZ,LINITB                                          ! line 20  -   YES----STEP DOWN.
        LCI,$15,1.0                                          ! line 21  -NO -- ERROR FLAG 1.
        CM1111(BU,1),LFINB,0.0                               ! line 22  -SET FINAL BIT TO 1.
        B,LERR4                                              ! line 23
LINITB  Z,0.0(LXPP)                                          ! line 24  -CLEAR SLOT.
        $TI,1,-1.0(LIODX),1.0(LXPP)                          ! line 25  -STORE PP ID (printed "$TI")
        CM1111(BU,1),TLPPEN(LXPP)                            ! line 26
        L(BU,24),1.0(LIODX)                                  ! line 27  -LOOK FOR REJ END COMBO
        BRZ,LFINAL                                           ! line 28  -( IF SO
        K(BU,24),LIOD                                        ! line 29  -IS THE FIRST CARD AN IOD
        BAE,LINBB                                            ! line 30  -YES
        LCI,$15,8.0                                          ! line 31  -NO    SEND ERROR FLAG
        B,LERROR                                             ! line 32
LINBB   BB,LOVBIT,LINITC-.32                                 ! line 33  -IF NOT OVERLAP MODE
        L(BU,64),0.0(LXIO),0.0                               ! line 34  -IS IOREQ SLOT AVAILABLE.
        BRZZ,LINITC                                          ! line 35  -   YES----STEP DOWN.
        B,LIOFUL                                             ! line 36  -   NO----TO SPECIAL ROUTINE.
        Z,0.0(LXIO)                                          ! line 37
LINITC  SV,LXIO,0.0(LXPP)                                    ! line 38  -PUT CRREF IN PPREF SLOT.
        CM0000(BU,9),LIOSCR,0.0                              ! line 39  -SET IODSQ COUNTER TO 1.
        M+1(BU,9),LIOSCR                                     ! line 40
        CM0000,LTAPEC                                        ! line 41  -SET REEL COUNT TO ZERO
        B,LFWA                                               ! line 42  -BRANCH TO TEST FWA.
! line 43  -
! line 44  - -----------------------------------------------------------
! line 45  -          IOD CARD ROUTINE
! line 46  - -----------------------------------------------------------
! line 47  -
        SLC, (8)231750.40
LIODRN  M+1,TIODCT(LXPP)                                     ! line 48  -STEP IOD COUNTER (printed "L ICDRN")
        L,LIREF(LIODX),0.0                                   ! line 49  -COMPARE FOR LARGEST
        K,TLREFN(LXPP)                                       ! line 50  -   PP REFERENCE NUMBER
        BALZ,LIODA                                           ! line 51  -THIS NO. IS LOW....STEP DOWN.
        ST,TLREFN(LXPP)                                      ! line 52  -HIGH.... REPLACE BY THIS NUMBER
        BB,LOVBIT,LIOD1-0.32                                 ! line 53
LIODA   L(BU,64),0.0(LXIO),0.0                               ! line 54  -IS IOREQ SLOT AVAILABLE.
        BRZZ,LIOD1                                           ! line 55  -   YES----STEP DOWN.
LIOFUL  LCI,$15,2.0                                          ! line 56  -NO -- ERROR FLAG 2.

!SYM LINIT  231715.40
!SYM LINITA 231720.00
!SYM LINITB 231732.40
!SYM LINBB  231741.00
!SYM LINITC 231744.40
!SYM LIODRN 231750.40
!SYM LIODA  231756.00
!SYM LIOFUL 231757.40
!CHECK 231715.40 | 000001.00 83 030000.20 50 | line 5 LINIT L(BU,24),1.0(LIODX)
!CHECK 231716.40 | 231547.13 10 | line 6 SX,LXIO,LSAVEY
!CHECK 231717.00 | 231550.15 10 | line 7 SX,LXFR,LSAVEZ
!CHECK 231717.40 | 231721.34 C2 | line 8 BRZ,LINITA+1.
!CHECK 231720.00 | 231545.51 80 001000.00 F0 | line 9 LINITA CM0000(BU,1),LFINB,0.0
!CHECK 231721.00 | 231545.73 80 001000.00 F0 | line 10 CM0000,LINFAD
!CHECK 231722.00 | 231545.53 80 007000.00 F0 | line 11 CM0000,LCOUNT
!CHECK 231723.00 | 231552.24 10 | line 12 LX,LWORKX,LCLEAR
!CHECK 231723.40 | 000000.22 0A | line 13 Z,0.0(LWORKX)
!CHECK 231724.00 | 231723.65 4C | line 14 CBR+,LWORKX,$-.32
!CHECK 231724.40 | 000024.24 10 | line 15 LX,LWORKX,LXPP
!CHECK 231725.00 | 000002.25 07 | line 16 V+ICR,LWORKX,2.0
!CHECK 231725.40 | 000000.44 8A 001000.20 50 | line 17 L,TJBPRO(LWORKX) (printed "TJBPRC")
!CHECK 231726.40 | 231732.74 C4 | line 18 BZRZZ,LINITB
!CHECK 231727.00 | 000000.00 8A 022000.20 50 | line 19 L,TCRREF(LWORKX)
!CHECK 231730.00 | 231732.74 C6 | line 20 BRZZ,LINITB
!CHECK 231730.40 | 000001.37 02 | line 21 LCI,$15,1.0
!CHECK 231731.00 | 231545.51 80 001000.36 F0 | line 22 CM1111(BU,1),LFINB,0.0
!CHECK 231732.00 | 232222.50 00 | line 23 B,LERR4
!CHECK 231732.40 | 000000.22 04 | line 24 LINITB Z,0.0(LXPP)
!CHECK 231733.00 | 777777.00 83 000001.02 A4 | line 25 TI,1,-1.0(LIODX),1.0(LXPP) (printed "$TI")
!CHECK 231734.00 | 000000.47 84 001000.36 F0 | line 26 CM1111(BU,1),TLPPEN(LXPP)
!CHECK 231735.00 | 000001.00 83 030000.20 50 | line 27 L(BU,24),1.0(LIODX)
!CHECK 231736.00 | 232126.34 C2 | line 28 BRZ,LFINAL
!CHECK 231736.40 | 231700.00 80 030000.21 10 | line 29 K(BU,24),LIOD
!CHECK 231737.40 | 231741.36 C2 | line 30 BAE,LINBB
!CHECK 231740.00 | 000010.37 02 | line 31 LCI,$15,8.0
!CHECK 231740.40 | 232200.10 00 | line 32 B,LERROR
!CHECK 231741.00 | 231545.62 80 231744.34 02 | line 33 LINBB BB,LOVBIT,LINITC-.32
!CHECK 231742.00 | 000000.00 85 000000.20 50 | line 34 L(BU,64),0.0(LXIO),0.0
!CHECK 231743.00 | 231744.74 C6 | line 35 BRZZ,LINITC
!CHECK 231743.40 | 231757.50 00 | line 36 B,LIOFUL
!CHECK 231744.00 | 000000.22 05 | line 37 Z,0.0(LXIO)
!CHECK 231744.40 | 000000.13 34 | line 38 LINITC SV,LXIO,0.0(LXPP)
!CHECK 231745.00 | 231545.40 80 011000.00 F0 | line 39 CM0000(BU,9),LIOSCR,0.0
!CHECK 231746.00 | 231545.40 80 011000.22 B0 | line 40 M+1(BU,9),LIOSCR
!CHECK 231747.00 | 231545.31 80 007000.00 F0 | line 41 CM0000,LTAPEC (last byte prints "FC")
!CHECK 231750.00 | 231714.10 00 | line 42 B,LFWA
!CHECK 231750.40 | 000000.64 84 014000.22 B0 | line 48 LIODRN M+1,TIODCT(LXPP)
!CHECK 231751.40 | 000000.64 83 014000.20 50 | line 49 L,LIREF(LIODX),0.0
!CHECK 231752.40 | 000000.50 84 014000.21 10 | line 50 K,TLREFN(LXPP)
!CHECK 231753.40 | 231756.36 46 | line 51 BALZ,LIODA
!CHECK 231754.00 | 000000.50 84 014000.20 D0 | line 52 ST,TLREFN(LXPP)
!CHECK 231755.00 | 231545.62 80 231760.74 02 | line 53 BB,LOVBIT,LIOD1-0.32
!CHECK 231756.00 | 000000.00 85 000000.20 50 | line 54 LIODA L(BU,64),0.0(LXIO),0.0
!CHECK 231757.00 | 231761.34 C6 | line 55 BRZZ,LIOD1
!CHECK 231757.40 | 000002.37 02 | line 56 LIOFUL LCI,$15,2.0
